{"suttaId":"thag3.8","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Th","vriCode":"s0508m.mul","paras":[1218,1227],"vripara":"240"},"segments":{"thag3.8:0.4":"Vassikattheragāthā","thag3.8:1.1":"“Ekopi saddho medhāvī, assaddhānīdha ñātinaṃ;","thag3.8:1.3":"Dhammaṭṭho sīlasampanno, hoti atthāya bandhunaṃ.","thag3.8:2.1":"“Niggayha anukampāya, coditā ñātayo mayā;","thag3.8:2.3":"Ñātibandhavapemena, kāraṃ katvāna bhikkhusu.","thag3.8:3.1":"“Te abbhatītā kālaṅkatā, pattā te tidivaṃ sukhaṃ;","thag3.8:3.3":"Bhātaro mayhaṃ mātā ca, modanti kāmakāmino”ti.","thag3.8:3.5":"… Vassiko [passiko (sī. syā. pī.)] thero …."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
